      en: ["The garden serves as a research center for Sahelian botany.", "It houses over 200 different species of trees and shrubs.", "The facility is a key location for environmental education for students.", "Specific programs are conducted for the conservation of medicinal plants.", "The garden provides saplings for the national 'Great Green Wall' project.", "Scientific collaborations exist with the University of Ouagadougou."],
      es: ["Fundado en 1998", "Superficie: 10 ha", "Más de 300 especies de plantas", "Herbario con 10.000 ejemplares", "100.000 visitantes al año", "Parte de la Universidad de Uagadugú"],
      pt: ["Fundado em 1998", "Área: 10 ha", "Mais de 300 espécies de plantas", "Herbário com 10.000 exemplares", "100.000 visitantes por ano", "Parte da Universidade de Ouagadougou"],
      fr: ["Fondé en 1998", "Superficie : 10 ha", "Plus de 300 espèces végétales", "Herbiers de 10 000 spécimens", "100 000 visiteurs par an", "Rattaché à l'Université de Ouagadougou"],
